    <string name="privacy_body">Muslim bu wo kokoam nsɛm na ɔnnye wo data ano.\n\n• Tracking biara nni hɔ: ad SDKs, analytics anaa marketing trackers biara nni hɔ.\n• Data tra wo device so: wɔde wo data nyinaa (beae, nhyehyɛe, bookmarks) sie wo mpɔtam hɔ wɔ wo device nkutoo so.\n• Beae a wɔde di dwuma wɔ mpɔtam hɔ: wɔde wo coordinates di dwuma de bu mpaebɔ ho akontaa mmere ne qibla a ɛwɔ wo mfiri no so, na wɔmfa nkɔ abɔnten so server biara so da.\n• Tumi krataa bere a ɛho hia nkutoo: yɛsrɛ tumi krataa (beae, amanneɛbɔ) bere a ade bi hia ankasa nkutoo, a nkyerɛkyerɛmu a emu da hɔ ka ho.\n• Nkitahodi a wɔhyɛ biara nni hɔ: app no yɛ adwuma wɔ intanɛt so; netwɛk dwumadie yɛ nea wɔpaw koraa ma nneɛma foforo te sɛ akenkan a wɔtwe.\n\nSaa nhyehyɛe yi yɛ adekorabea a wɔabue ano no fã na wɔabue ama mpɔtam hɔfo ahwɛ mu.</string>
